- [ ] See: `   Expected: transition(prevState, "START_VALIDATION", context)`
- [ ] See: `   Key: uuid-1234`
- [ ] See: `   Expectation Met: true`
- [ ] Verify exact code expected to be called

**Story Beat 4: Work Trigger**
- [ ] See: `3. Work: validateBasket starting`
- [ ] See: `   Expected: validateBasket(payload, idempotencyKey)`
- [ ] See: `   <useWorkTrigger> validateBasket(payload, idempotencyKey)`
- [ ] See: `   Expectation Met: true`
