- [ ] See: `   Stripe: https://checkout.stripe.com/...`
- [ ] See: `   Expectation Met: true`
- [ ] Confirm exact code with payload expected to be called

**Story Beat 4: Event**
- [ ] See: `5. Event: PASS_VALIDATION`
- [ ] See: `   Expected: dispatch({ type: "PASS_VALIDATION", payload: { stripeUrl: url } })`
- [ ] See: `   <validateBasket> dispatch({ type: "PASS_VALIDATION", payload: { stripeUrl: url })`
- [ ] See: `   Expectation Met: true`
- [ ] Confirm full dispatch call with payload logged (not translated)

**Story Beat 5: Final State**
