- [ ] See: `   Expected: transition(prevState, "PASS_VALIDATION", context)`
- [ ] See: `   Expectation Met: true`
- [ ] See: `=== CHECKOUT READY ===`
- [ ] Confirm exact code expected to be called

**Story Check: Work Flow**
- [ ] Story reads: Work started (with full code) -> Server processed (with expected) -> Result ready (with expected code) -> Event (with full code) -> State updated (with expected code) -> Ready
- [ ] Each step shows exact code expected and actual code called
- [ ] Each step shows `Expectation Met: true/false`
- [ ] Discrepancy field only appears when expectation is false
